+# Todo Due Date Implementation Plan
+
+> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.
+
+**Goal:** Implement optional due dates, UTC overdue status, and overdue filtering in the existing API and list page for ticket `adw/demo-todo#1`.
+
+**Architecture:** The in-memory store validates dates and projects fresh Todo responses with a derived overdue flag. The HTTP handler filters those responses; the page renders the returned fields and fetches the selected list when its checkbox changes.
+
+**Tech Stack:** Node 24, builtins only, ES modules, `node:test`, native browser DOM/fetch, Playwright MCP.
+
+**Spec:** `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-14-todo-due-date-design.md` (approved).
+
+## Global Constraints
+
+- „Alle Änderungen verwenden ausschließlich Node-Bordmittel.“ No dependencies.
+- „Setzen, Ändern und Entfernen erfolgen ausschließlich über die API.“
+- „Kein Sortieren, keine Erinnerungen, keine zusätzlichen Eingabeformulare und kein Styling.“
+- „Ungültige Eingaben werfen `ValidationError` aus `src/store.mjs` und ergeben HTTP 400.“
+- „Screenshots werden außerhalb des Repositorys gespeichert.“
+- UTC defines today; only open, dated Todos with a date strictly before today are overdue.
+- Write and observe a failing test before each implementation task. Preserve existing test IDs.
+- Work on `1_faelligkeitsdatum_fuer_todos`; draft PR targets `main`. Do not merge or close the ticket.
+
+## Review Focus
+
+1. Invalid PATCH with otherwise valid title/done must leave every stored field unchanged (Task 1).
+2. Clients sending `overdue` must not override the server's derived status (Task 2).
+3. UTC midnight and offset-bearing clocks must not use the host's local date (Task 1).
+4. Reordered responses from rapid checkbox changes must preserve the last selection (Task 3).
+5. Titles containing HTML characters must remain literal text alongside the date/marker (Task 3).
+
+## File Structure
+
+- Modify `src/store.mjs`: date validation, atomic updates, clock injection, response projection.
+- Create `test/store.test.mjs`: deterministic store behavior and calendar validation tests.
+- Modify `src/app.mjs`: query validation and overdue list filtering.
+- Modify `test/app.test.mjs`: injected store fixture, extended response contract, HTTP tests.
+- Modify `public/index.html`: date/marker rendering, checkbox, fresh fetches, response ordering.
+- Keep browser evidence outside the repository; do not add test frameworks or generated artifacts.
+
